title: "ACS Framework (Asymmetric Codependent Systems)"
abstract: >-
  Canonical manuscripts, mathematical notes, verification suites, and
  reproduction harnesses for the Asymmetric Codependent Systems (ACS)
  theoretical framework. All claims are tracked under a four-tier
  verification hierarchy (machine-verified / proved / numerically
  verified / falsified), with falsifications logged openly in an
  elimination ledger.
